OL,3,GNEWSAAnnual arts festival set to return
OL,4,Ain October
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn annual Surrey arts festival,
OL,7,Ffeaturing more than 100 events, is due
OL,8,Fto take place next month as it
OL,9,Fapproaches its 30th anniversary.
OL,11,FArts Alive will run from 1 to 31
OL,12,FOctober across Mole Valley district,
OL,13,Fincluding historical talks, walking
OL,14,Ftours, music, theatre performances and
OL,15,Fcreative workshops, and will kick off
OL,16,Fwith launch events in Leatherhead and
OL,17,FDorking at the end of September.
OL,19,FAbout 14,000 people attended last
OL,20,Fyear's festival, according to the
OL,21,Fcouncil.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
