OL,3,GNEWSAAnnual arts festival set to return
OL,4,Ain October
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe authority's leisure and community
OL,7,Fassets lead, Nick Wright, said it was
OL,8,F"delighted" to continue investing in
OL,9,Fthe arts and culture of the district.
